Interchange EducationOrgCalendar [2518]
    documentation 'The Education Organization Calendar interchange carries school calendar 
                  'information. It can be used to exchange school calendar data, including 
                  'instructional days, sessions, and grading periods.
    element Session [2518-001]
    element GradingPeriod [2518-002]
    element CalendarDate [2518-003]
    element AcademicWeek [2518-004]